      "content": "the regular support people just loop me through a script and it feels like they're trying to stall me while they move more money around. i'm worried if i call the executive line it just alerts them that i'm onto them. is there a way to move my funds or set things up so they can't freeze my access or complete the liquidation before i can get my money out? i need to stay one step ahead of them.",
